# The repo moved from Windows to Fedora on 2026-08-23; Windows checkouts had
# core.autocrlf=true, so the working tree arrived CRLF against an LF index and
# every text file read as modified. Pin LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows shim: cmd.exe is happiest with CRLF.
mote.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pt binary
*.bin binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
